  	<TABLE class="content_text" WIDTH="95%" BORDER="0" CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0">
    <tr>
      <td valign="top">
        <div class="content_heading1">Upgrade your Symmetry Live Desktop</div>
        <hr noshade size="1">
        <div class="content_text">
          <p>The latest version of the Symmetry Live Desktop application is &quot;<font color="#CC0000">Symmetry Live, v1.0</font>&quot;.&nbsp;&nbsp;You can check the version that you have by right-clicking on the Symmetry Live icon in your Windows task tray and selecting &quot;About Symmetry Live&quot;.</p>
        </div>
        <hr noshade size="1">
        <div class="content_text">
          <p>To upgrade your Symmetry Live Desktop application:</p>
          <ol>
            <li class="content_text">
              If the Symmetry Live Desktop application is currently running on your computer (indicated by a Symmetry Live  icon in the Windows task tray), close Symmetry Live by right-clicking on the Symmetry Live icon and choosing &quot;Exit&quot;.
            </li><br><br>
            <li class="content_text">
              Click <a href="x-res/setup.exe">here</a> to download the newest Symmetry Live Desktop application.
            </li><br><br>
            <li class="content_text">
              Select &quot;Open&quot; or &quot;Run&quot; when prompted by the &quot;file download&quot; dialog box.
            </li><br><br>
            <li class="content_text">
              Complete the installation once the download is complete.
            </li><br><br>
            <li class="content_text">
              The new Symmetry Live Desktop application will automatically start.
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p><b>Note:</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;After the upgrade, if you do not see the Symmetry Live icon in your Windows task tray you can manually restart Symmetry Live by selecting &quot;Symmetry Live&quot; from the &quot;Symmetry Live&quot; program group located in your Windows start menu.</p>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
    </table>
					<!-- End Content Area -->
